  kind: 1
  title: "Ki\u1EC3m tra nhanh \u2014 ng\xE0y 8"
  intro: "B\xE0i tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp: c\xE2u h\u1ECFi nhi\u1EC5u nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n.
    Ch\u1ECDn \u0111\xE1p \xE1n ch\u1EB7t ch\u1EBD nh\u1EA5t (ki\u1EC3u event h\xE0i
    h\u01B0\u1EDBc)."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] R\u1EE7i ro d\u1EF1 \xE1n: 'mitigation'
      g\u1EA7n ngh\u0129a l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "Gi\u1EA3m x\xE1c su\u1EA5t/t\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng"
    - "T\u0103ng r\u1EE7i ro \u0111\u1EC3 nhanh"
    - "B\u1ECF qua r\u1EE7i ro"
    - "Chuy\u1EC3n r\u1EE7i ro cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng m\xE0 kh\xF4ng th\xF4ng
      b\xE1o"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] Trong qu\u1EA3n l\xFD th\u1EDDi gian, 'Pomodoro'
      c\u1ED5 \u0111i\u1EC3n th\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE0:"
    options:
    - "25 ph\xFAt t\u1EADp trung + ngh\u1EC9 ng\u1EAFn"
    - "90 ph\xFAt li\xEAn t\u1EE5c"
    - "5 ph\xFAt l\xE0m 5 ph\xFAt ngh\u1EC9 v\xF4 h\u1EA1n"
    - "H\u1ECDc \u0111\u1EBFn khi ng\u1EA5t"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] T\u01B0 duy ph\u1EA3n bi\u1EC7n: 'ngu\u1ED3n
      tin c\u1EADy' n\xEAn \u01B0u ti\xEAn \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "B\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m ch\u1EE9ng, xu\u1EA5t x\u1EE9
      r\xF5"
    - "Ch\u1EEF IN HOA tr\xEAn Facebook"
    - "Nhi\u1EC1u emoji h\u01A1n"
    - "C\u1EA3m x\xFAc m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] M\u1ED9t l\u1EADp lu\u1EADn 'ad hominem'
      l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "T\u1EA5n c\xF4ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi thay v\xEC t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng lu\u1EADn \u0111i\u1EC3m"
    - "D\xF9ng s\u1ED1 li\u1EC7u"
    - "D\xF9ng v\xED d\u1EE5 t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EF1"
    - "H\u1ECFi ng\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EA1i \u0111\xFAng tr\u1ECDng t\xE2m"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] Ch\u1ECDn c\xE2u \u0111\xFAng v\u1EC1 'bias'
      trong th\u1ED1ng k\xEA/h\u1ECDc m\xE1y (nh\u1EADp m\xF4n):"
    options:
    - "M\xF4 h\xECnh c\xF3 th\u1EC3 h\u1ECDc sai h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng do d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u/
      gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBnh"
    - "Bias lu\xF4n b\u1EB1ng 0 n\u1EBFu d\xF9ng GPU"
    - "Bias ch\u1EC9 x\u1EA3y ra khi v\u1EBD bi\u1EC3u \u0111\u1ED3"
    - "Bias l\xE0 l\u1ED7i c\xFA ph\xE1p"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
